cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RCK in research, please cite it as below."
title: "RCK: Resonant Cognitive Kernel"
abstract: >-
  A symbolic, non-generative reasoning system: facts live as discrete
  (subject, relation, object) triples in a sharded HRR/VSA
  hyperdimensional vector memory; reasoning is an explicit,
  inspectable pipeline with derivation-graph provenance, calibrated
  confidence, gated fact induction, belief revision, negative facts,
  and federated merge. 100,000 real-world facts on a single CPU
  thread with sub-millisecond queries.
type: software
